    "https://wsu.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Pullman-WA/Fiscal-Specialist-1_R-15337": {
      "title": "Fiscal Specialist 1",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-31\nPosted: Posted 8 Days Ago\nFull time\n\nOnline applications must be received before 11:59pm on: September 17, 2026 If a date is not listed above, review the Applicant Instructions below for more details. Available Title(s): 151E-YN_CS_NPS - Fiscal Specialist 1 Business Title: Fiscal Specialist 1 Employee Type: Classified Position Details: The Opportunity:   The Office of Research at Washington State University (WSU) is responsible for advancing the research enterprise at WSU systemwide. The Office of Research facilitates all aspects of the research from pre-award to compliance, advancement, development, and commercialization. The Office of Research amplifies WSU's land-grant mission by partnering with the university community, industry leaders, and other stakeholders to advance, extend, and grow the positive impact of WSU research for the state, region, and nation. Summary of Duties: Under general supervision the Fiscal Specialist 1 performs a variety of fiscal and administrative functions for the entire Office of Research area. The primary functions include maintaining and modifying fiscal records & IP databases; tracking and maintaining records related to internally funded innovation projects, invoicing clients for income and reimbursements; receiving, reviewing, and recording all incoming payments; maintaining and purchasing office supplies; reconciling monthly purchasing cards and travel card; preparing specialized financial reports; performing fiscal tasks in Workday, and other clerical duties as assigned. The Fiscal Specialist 1 will exercise independent judgement to interpret and apply principles of established procedures; independently advise staff regarding applicable policies; and make recommendations to improve efficiency.  55% Fiscal Support 25% Intellectual Property(IP) Data Management 15% Business Operations 5% Other Additional Information: This is a full-time (100 % FTE), permanent position. This position 